Package: AmmoniTools
Title: Geometric morphometric Tools for Ammonite Shells
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Aimie", "Doriath Döhler",
  email = "aimie.doriathdohler@gmail.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"),
  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-6984-9989"))
Maintainer: Aimie DORIATH DOHLER <aimie.doriathdohler@gmail.com>
Description: AmmoniTools provides a comprehensive set of tools for geometric morphometric analyses of ammonite shells. The package includes functions for processing successive 3D peristome landmarks, reconstructing missing data using biologically informed strategies,    and performing Procrustes-based shape analyses. It is designed to integrate seamlessly with existing morphometric workflows, notably those implemented in 'geomorph' and 'Morpho', and offers both quantitative and visualization tools to investigate ammonite shell morphology, ontogeny, and intraspecific variation.
